  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the Integration of Venezuelan Refugees and Migrants into Peruvian Host Communities through Socioeconomic Interventions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support the integration of Venezuelan refugees and migrants in Peru through socioeconomic interventions, that allow them to enjoy their human rights within an inclusive society and contribute to national development and peacebuilding in Peru. The intervention has a national-wide scope and aims to enhance the self-reliance of migrants, strengthen their integration and social participation, and contribute to increasing the incorporation of skilled professionals within the host communities.</narrative>
  </description>
